        <strong>Inline search:</strong> Search lives in the sidebar rather than a full-screen overlay.
        Typing filters channels, threads, and messages in place — no context switch required.
      </div>
      <div class="ds-annotation" style="margin:0">
        <strong>Same no-hubs model:</strong> Public, Private, Sessions, and DMs carry over from the
        mobile prototype with identical semantics. The larger canvas makes channel type distinctions
        clearer at a glance.
      </div>
      <div class="ds-annotation" style="margin:0">
        <strong>Incoming call toast:</strong> On iPad the call notification slides in from the
        top-right corner rather than the top-center — keeping it out of the way of the sidebar
        while remaining immediately actionable.
      </div>
      <div class="ds-annotation" style="margin:0">
        <strong>Thread panel:</strong> 280px column on the right. When no thread is selected it
        shows an empty state. Clicking a thread badge in the sidebar or a message opens the thread
        root + replies inline with a composer at the bottom.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /flex row -->
</div><!-- /ds-section -->

